{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>初代《神奇女俠》扮演者蓮黛卡達Lynda Carter，在社交網絡分享多張照片，包括一張她躺在戶外浴缸裏，旁邊放着一杯馬提尼酒的照片，引發了數十條讚賞的評論。</p><p>一位網友激動地說：</p><figure><img alt=\"70年代飾演神奇女俠的演員卡達（Lynda Carter）深入民心 （網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/247688/org/249f23cec47c054eae45c4b7cf6c6f44.jpg/QoRTeLheLSkm3qaZt3MK7y2PYRoka0iKWAHgaFgB4Gg\"/><figcaption>70年代飾演神奇女俠的演員卡達（Lynda Carter）深入民心 （網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>更多Lynda Carter的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162335699752456192129673.jpeg/PGHRyGIMwNNtbZuZEt-IJLcRL52aKvsOwZuKV8Gbilc\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter（網絡圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162339663348764672963087.jpeg/Bc2eLKajXDmDNafh6WXDoNYqL8HOl3VYcpWfnHKVn5w\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter（網絡圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162335702390804480061259.jpeg/bBWiKeJS6WnCVXPjZw2oXl6fkGD9Mwb-R8Tp_0fE6f8\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter（網絡圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162339668180865024794182.jpeg/C3CtsDMe4xyYDiD8rjxmOu_E66MFHXcDURmKFlEZihY\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter（網絡圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162335704991404032561830.jpeg/5haQ1TcjGgb0Bm4e9WHYpS2OMDNwCHsBxi2ITMYtiEw\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter（網絡圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162339670823407616239718.jpeg/PbQZvFKIQqW4zkZaaM5rpWM1dnGiOHKtBKVF3ASlRdw\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter（網絡圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162103949327601664014768.jpeg/al-kdB0Q_-2gimXrXcqAiDOirxoxIwox9lDR2fZQ0dk\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162103958366851072894715.jpeg/Y77xe2F3JZlixNQ0cVSYo09UbKc7-z1Fak_ehGpP3oQ\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter（網絡圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260807/1162339665760620544680392.jpeg/ZW-tLWCraGzQHRPunldMy8y3aPD-NFDySNb7LkjW-y4\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter（網絡圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162103952045641728605739.jpeg/2yl_X6bFnuYW_tqKhNMvIk_lJ_61O_doWUw1qFlMNag\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162103953996124160531467.jpeg/G8rjBbBmxcXBlfnrMbYnZdRpGjbrfWargM7wvYDO8L0\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162103956085018624327058.jpeg/Kb3D6GVqviaBzQg7hQ55bzryZCST5EDUbtVqt27Varc\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162103948828479488351246.jpeg/niaFh2jrEllxSlSAvub9RFVN7m_PCeAPwXRFosF0RaI\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162103951252918272146502.jpeg/6HzMNLIeNhGJ5z3pNkAQ2iDAbR_D-rRNgJ7nCYCe5wk\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter在社交平台分享的相片（Instagram@reallyndacarter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lynda Carter版的神奇女俠當年被視為性感icon。（劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/1379546/org/fd0d694348e76dc1eba21050e65ba12f.jpg/PJfh8JAhkhopC0Gi7aaSTBFrk-JELSOk_aeXVP2nl1Q\"/><figcaption>Lynda Carter版的神奇女俠當年被視為性感icon。（劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"1975年，由美國女星Lynda Carter主演的電視劇《神奇女俠》，令這個漫畫人物變成家傳戶曉的女神。其實，心理學教授William Marston當年創作神奇女俠，目的確是做出一個新時代女性的典範。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/626466/org/83951bef488efc43797f82f730c4b061.jpg/v-3yjQJF1cLg7oOosiqS8OodNxHV5KZ57Q9Fze0PRc0\"/><figcaption>1975年，由美國女星Lynda Carter主演的電視劇《神奇女俠》，令這個漫畫人物變成家傳戶曉的女神。其實，心理學教授William Marston當年創作神奇女俠，目的確是做出一個新時代女性的典範。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>「我的天哪，她是不是越來越年輕了？！」一位粉絲寫道，另一位粉絲則評論道：「是的是的是的，你依然美得驚豔。展現你永遠的魅力吧，我們永遠的神奇女俠。」</p><p>「等不及了！@reallyndacarter你看起來棒極了！！你都不會老！！」另一位粉絲附和道。</p><p>卡達還分享了她即將上映的電影《五個出更的哨兵3》中的劇照，其他照片中，她與《傳媒家族繼承人》的演員拜仁確斯和導演傑伊錢德拉薩卡合影。卡達於7月24日迎來75歲生日，她分享了一組照片，宣傳她在即將上映的喜劇電影《五個出更的哨兵3》中的角色，該片於8月7日上映。</p><p>卡達最初以選美明星的身份出道，1972年榮獲美國世界小姐桂冠，並在1972年世界小姐大賽中躋身前15名。她因在1975年至1979年播出的電視劇中飾演神奇女俠而聲名鵲起。</p><p>延伸閲讀：77歲Vera Wang生日近照超震撼　金髮細腰凍齡如少女　保養秘訣曝</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閲讀：77歲Vera Wang生日近照超震撼　金髮細腰凍齡如少女　保養秘訣曝】王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149657603555463168801976.jpeg/LOFDGr7uQbfl3rbY3RDyh9SQRTf1i7l4K6Pj0Cuj49A\"/><figcaption>【延伸閲讀：77歲Vera Wang生日近照超震撼　金髮細腰凍齡如少女　保養秘訣曝】王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang分享的77歲生日派對相片（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658630383996928723469.jpeg/zMXjMm8k6-i3KW6URrWcglr92FLkJsHXO4Z5gjuGeYI\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang分享的77歲生日派對相片（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang分享的77歲生日派對相片（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658633433387008459628.jpeg/59h_3QbeanA1QSKVK4s137Hwqk17dy_PcC3doXAt3aE\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang分享的77歲生日派對相片（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang分享的77歲生日派對相片（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658636168204288675184.jpeg/F13VJxJtmJ_o05OSHQ77Rib6ThfFWrrJJ5iXPSeYlz0\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang分享的77歲生日派對相片（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang分享的77歲生日派對相片（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658638689112064670248.jpeg/KZu2-OZQxuB_DITrCe2nTELF58fAMK4VfGGp6Xxhqek\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang分享的77歲生日派對相片（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang分享的77歲生日派對相片（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658641428123648604357.jpeg/bnL7ndMKduaOc94XFsQlW1M6BFG8ev0czOcCh8znAoc\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang分享的77歲生日派對相片（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang分享的77歲生日派對相片（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658624776212480345908.jpeg/5jkzyq6VPUn6U8qzOEdQXt9uLDVaFZoGHIAO5hyADuY\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang分享的77歲生日派對相片（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658627762688000931640.jpeg/cPuP_8JyTXJSZn5sAEGcgVer-MEWVSyN5foP1OX6D9Q\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658630237458432514792.jpeg/jLyxGWSRQnkWmpCh_IgiHlSOgWM1Oul6Ks7GdyrOxnc\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658633320402944139548.jpeg/1aypHyEN71sQs3zayE8zmFMPlM8tKYAM-ma5xPpmucQ\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658635421880320198526.jpeg/KMa7q_hheoQaSH1pfmiuDpi4kYUsXyAcuT9bMLk_WzA\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658633827520512803912.jpeg/NSbs-PIw3zIHGjlngANV66fUcJigxKmZEE7HexBOx3s\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658636293902336507349.jpeg/MCoA30Qgn7PD_b1b4rSlqJQRHhFFXVqNONr4hjja-IY\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658639058079744471253.jpeg/FAGmnhzvVqcdkruczsNxEzY155OfdPvABjvdoQY73aE\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658641662873600197384.jpeg/HRyW__7KUdvRklEw-N4hUyYKmsWORaoEVixCYlYsQmI\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658644750012416325796.jpeg/yQdfgzE2KaiZHn88fc8RnEP3eT2XjhD661SGrutUhq4\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149658617876582400958143.jpeg/00TP-ZVFFkc9Ny64SlZiEWwwjXzcgvt-CWS9UAlkvVA\"/><figcaption>王薇薇Vera Wang（Instagram@verawang）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「快科技」授權轉載，微信公眾號：mydrivers】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T01:29:21.406086+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1955,"images":34,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"non